# The App Store Connect app identifier. Keep this in lockstep with
# capacitor.config.json (appId) and the Xcode project (PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER);
# APPSTORE.md tracks all three if the owner corrects the bundle id.
app_identifier("com.playope.ope")

# No apple_id / team_id / itc_team_id here on purpose: every fastlane action
# authenticates with the App Store Connect API key (ASC_* secrets, wired in the
# Fastfile), which carries the team context. That keeps CI free of Apple ID
# passwords and 2FA.
